orresponding letter numbering>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<Respond to the Question 2 with the corresponding letter numbering>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## Scenario\nElise and Damon had been the best of friends since their high school days. Recently, Elise developed feelings for Damon and decided to confess. She rehearsed and finally, with her heart pounding, she confessed her feelings. Damon told her he had been in a relationship with someone else for a couple of months. Elise congratulated him and left hurriedly.\n\n## Question 1\nWhat emotion(s) would Elise ultimately feel in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 1\nA) Disappointment & Jealousy\nB) Anticipation & Sentimental\nC) Anticipation & Gratitude\nD) Gratitude & Sentimental\nE) Jealousy & Sentimental\nF) Jealousy & Gratitude\n\n## Question 2\nWhy would Elise feel these emotions in this situation?\n\n## Choices for Question 2\nA) Damon is no longer her friend & Damon did not tell her about his relationship earlier\nB) She found out the man he likes is in a relationship with someone else & She wanted Damon to confess\nC) She confessed her love to her friend and got rejected & She found out the man he likes is in a relationship with someone else\nD) Damon did not tell her about his relationship earlier & She wanted Damon to confess\nE) Elise did not rehearse her confession properly & She found out the man he likes is in a relationship with someone else\nF) Damon is no longer her friend & She found out the man he likes is in a relationship with someone else","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e8e0d6006945d280aa6f","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794369760640,"createTime":"2026-11-11 12:02:40","